  "notes": "All sources verified live via web search on 2026-08-13 (facebook_pages) and 2026-08-15 (CAJ/Ombudsman addition + x_handle/instagram_handle reference fields). facebook_pages sourced directly from Ardhi AI's own 'Following' list (6 pages, screenshot confirmed). x_handle/instagram_handle fields are reference metadata only (not read by the query builder, which searches by org name) - they exist so the data itself documents which verified accounts each org runs. CAJ (Commission on Administrative Justice / Ombudsman Kenya) added 2026-08-15 after it surfaced as the agency that broke the Shamakhokho compensation deadlock - it had no prior dedicated tracking entry. social_platforms (X, YouTube, TikTok, LinkedIn) are NOT scraped directly - none offer a free, ToS-compliant public feed - so they're covered the same way facebook_pages are: via Google News RSS with a site: filter, which surfaces news coverage that embeds or reports on posts from these platforms. reddit_watch IS a direct integration - Reddit publishes genuine public search RSS/Atom feeds with no auth required, added 2026-08-14."
